{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40518","headline":"药草 · 苏拯","name":"药草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子恤疲瘵，坤灵奉其职。\n年年济世功，贵贱相兼植。\n因产衆草中，所希采者识。\n一枝当若神，千金亦何直。\n生草不生药，无以彰土德。\n生药不生草，无以彰奇特。\n国忠在臣贤，民患凭药力。\n灵草犹如此，贤人岂多得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}